%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'24px', 'fontFamily':'Arial, sans-serif'}, 'flowchart': {'htmlLabels': true, 'nodeSpacing': 30, 'rankSpacing': 50}}}%%
graph TB
    Start[Client Consultation] --> CaseType{Select Case Type}
    
    %% Primary Case Types with Forms Listed
    CaseType -->|Divorce| Divorce[Divorce Process<br/>Form 8A: Application for Divorce<br/>Form 36: Affidavit for Divorce<br/>Form 13.1: Financial Statement<br/>Form 25A: Divorce Order]
    
    CaseType -->|Family Matters| Family[Family Disputes<br/>Form 8: General Application<br/>Form 10: Answer<br/>Form 10A: Reply]
    
    CaseType -->|Children| Children[Children's Matters<br/>Form 8B: Child Protection<br/>Form 8D: Adoption<br/>Form 34: Child's Consent<br/>Form 34F: Parent's Consent]
    
    CaseType -->|Emergency| Emergency[Emergency Relief<br/>Form 25F: Restraining Order<br/>Form 14D: Ex Parte Order<br/>Form 25G: Motion Restraining]
    
    %% Financial Disclosure Section
    Divorce --> Financial[Financial Disclosure<br/>Form 13: Support Claims<br/>Form 13.1: Property & Support<br/>Form 13B: Net Family Property<br/>Form 13C: Comparison NFP<br/>Form 27: Request Financial]
    Family --> Financial
    
    %% Motion Process
    Family --> Motions[Motion Process<br/>Form 14: Notice of Motion<br/>Form 14A: Affidavit<br/>Form 14B: Motion Form<br/>Form 14C: Confirmation]
    Financial --> Motions
    
    %% Motion to Change
    Motions --> Changes[Changes & Variations<br/>Form 15: Motion to Change<br/>Form 15B: Response<br/>Form 15C: Consent Motion<br/>Form 15D: Consent Child Support]
    
    %% Conference Process
    Motions --> Conference[Conferences<br/>Form 17A: Case Conference Brief<br/>Form 17C: Settlement Conference<br/>Form 17E: Trial Management<br/>Form 17F: Confirmation]
    Changes --> Conference
    
    %% Trial Process
    Conference --> Trial[Trial Process<br/>Form 20: Request for Order<br/>Form 22: Request to Admit<br/>Form 23: Summons to Witness<br/>Form 23C: Uncontested Trial]
    
    %% Court Orders
    Trial --> Orders[Court Orders<br/>Form 25: General Order<br/>Form 25A: Divorce Order<br/>Form 25D: Uncontested Order<br/>Form 25F: Restraining Order]
    Emergency --> Orders
    
    %% Enforcement
    Orders --> Enforcement[Enforcement Actions<br/>Form 26: Statement Money Owed<br/>Form 28: Writ of Seizure<br/>Form 29: Garnishment Request<br/>Form 30: Default Hearing<br/>Form 31: Contempt Motion]
    
    %% Service Documents (Supporting Process)
    Service[Service Documents<br/>Form 4: Change Representation<br/>Form 6B: Affidavit of Service<br/>Form 6C: Certificate of Service]
    
    %% Special Processes
    Special[Special Processes<br/>Form 37: Interjurisdictional Support<br/>Form 43: Legal Advice Request<br/>Form 43A: Online Consultation]
    
    %% Connect Service to main processes
    Family -.-> Service
    Divorce -.-> Service
    Motions -.-> Service
    Enforcement -.-> Service
    
    CaseType -->|Special Cases| Special
    
    %% Styling with colors for different sections
    classDef divorceClass fill:#ffe6e6,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:3px
    classDef familyClass fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px
    classDef childClass fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2,stroke-width:3px
    classDef emergencyClass fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,stroke-width:3px
    classDef financialClass fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:3px
    classDef motionClass fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#fbc02d,stroke-width:3px
    classDef conferenceClass fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#8e24aa,stroke-width:3px
    classDef trialClass fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,stroke-width:3px
    classDef orderClass fill:#e8eaf6,stroke:#5e35b1,stroke-width:3px
    classDef enforceClass fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:3px
    classDef serviceClass fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#757575,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    classDef specialClass fill:#e0f2f1,stroke:#00796b,stroke-width:3px
    
    class Divorce divorceClass
    class Family familyClass
    class Children childClass
    class Emergency emergencyClass
    class Financial financialClass
    class Motions,Changes motionClass
    class Conference conferenceClass
    class Trial trialClass
    class Orders orderClass
    class Enforcement enforceClass
    class Service serviceClass
    class Special specialClass